          "html": "<p>Game designer and producer with 6+ years in the industry. I design systems, balancing and combat, and I run the production behind them: managing teams of 5 to 70, setting priorities and delivery dates, and keeping disciplines aligned. I’ve owned features from combat through vertical slice, taken a Fortnite mode through launch and live updates with Bandai Namco, and co-founded the studio behind an award-winning PC game.</p>"
